  "notes": "Flowing water (minecraft:water level 1) fill at x 302-304, y 121-123, z 308-312 (setup terrain, not a Create block). Water wheel (305,122,310) on the west face of a shaft (306,122,310); shaft on the west face of the mechanical press (307,122,310); depot (307,121,310) under the press. Pieces placed in the order depot, press, shaft, wheel so each place step has a solid neighbour. Press faces along X (player at yaw 270) so its axis is X and the shaft mates with its back. One iron ingot on the depot by interact; wait 8 s (recipe timer ~5 s at 32 rpm, 8 s gives margin); the iron sheet is taken from the depot with an empty hand. Truth expectation: create:iron_sheet x1 in inventory. Ingot count goes 1 -> 0 on both.",
